OL,3,AThe Scouse actor reaching new heights
OL,4,Ain Liverpool drama This City Is Ours
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith millions of viewers and a major
OL,7,Frole in a Bafta-nominated series, you
OL,8,Fmight not expect Adam Abbou to know
OL,9,Fmuch about feeling self-conscious.
OL,11,F"When we were kids it wasn't so cool to
OL,12,Fbe from Liverpool," the This City Is
OL,13,FOurs actor says.
OL,15,F"I'd be in these rooms with people who
OL,16,Fwere really posh and I always felt out
OL,17,Fof place."
OL,19,FThe Liverpool-based BBC series has
OL,20,Fbecome a hit, with Abbou, who plays
OL,21,FFreddie, stepping into a prominent role
OL,22,Ffor its second season.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
